sequenceDiagram
	participant UI as Storefront\n(Next.js 16 + AG-UI)
	participant Chat as Chat API\n(Agent Framework /ag-ui)
	participant Blob as Azure Blob Storage\n(chatting-blob/ag-ui/)
	participant Dec as Microsoft Foundry\n(MicrosoftDecision1)
	participant PII as Presidio\n(Analyzer & Anonymizer)
	participant LLM as Microsoft Foundry\n(ModelRouter)
	participant MCP as MCP Tools\n(/mcp -> Catalog gRPC)
	participant Rating as Rating API\n(A2A gRPC /agents)

	UI ->> Chat: HTTPS POST /chatting/ag-ui (Entra ID JWT, PerUserRateLimit)
	Chat ->> Blob: Load conversation session state
	Chat ->> Chat: InputValidationExecutor (length + prompt-injection check)
	Chat ->> Dec: DecisionRouterExecutor (language, scope, route confidence)

	alt Low confidence in-scope route
		Chat -->> UI: RequestPort HITL disambiguation prompt
		UI ->> Chat: Customer selects intended route
	end

	alt Book or QA specialist
		Chat ->> PII: Anonymize PII in outbound prompt
		Chat ->> LLM: Run BookAgent (or sub-researchers) / QAAgent
		LLM ->> MCP: MCP Streamable HTTP: search_catalog / get_book (Policies/mcp-tools.yaml)
		MCP -->> LLM: Grounded Catalog facts
		LLM -->> Chat: Draft response (PII-checked)
	else Rating specialist (book ID present)
		Chat ->> Rating: Remote A2A gRPC (Entra Agent Identity, rating_read scope)
		Rating -->> Chat: Grounded review summary
	end
	Chat ->> Chat: ResponseFormatterExecutor
	Chat ->> Blob: Persist updated session transcript
	Chat -->> UI: Stream formatted AG-UI response
